sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(21,101,192,0.04) Internal zone: your service and database
    participant H as Host service (@Transactional)
    participant RE as RuleEngine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant SCH as Scheduler thread
  end

  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over H,DB: decision-log.mode = transactional (one host transaction)
    H->>RE: evaluate("card-fee", input)
    RE->>DB: INSERT rle_decision (same connection and transaction)
    RE-->>H: DecisionResult
    alt host commits
      H->>DB: COMMIT: business rows and decision row persist together
    else host throws
      H->>DB: ROLLBACK: 0 decision rows, no orphan
    end
  end

  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over H,DB: decision-log.mode = async, TX1 (host transaction)
    H->>RE: evaluate("card-fee", input)
    RE->>DB: INSERT rle_decision_queue (same transaction, one narrow row, durable at COMMIT)
    RE-->>H: DecisionResult
    H->>DB: COMMIT
  end
  rect rgba(236,239,241,0.9)
    Note over SCH,DB: async, TX2 (scheduler transaction, later)
    SCH->>DB: move up to 100 oldest queue rows (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    SCH->>DB: DELETE queue rows and INSERT rle_decision (log_mode=ASYNC) in one statement, COMMIT
    Note over SCH,DB: log lags by the poll interval, visible as log_mode=ASYNC, and over max-backlog evaluate is refused with 503 DECISION_LOG_BACKLOG
  end
